--------------------------------------------------
FINAL UX GOAL
--------------------------------------------------

The platform should make a complicated soil-management process feel simple.

A user should be able to understand within 5 seconds:

1. What material exists
2. Where it is
3. How much exists
4. When it is available
5. Who could use it
6. Whether requirements are complete
7. How much the route costs
8. What the fallback option is

The emotional experience should be:

certainty
clarity
control
lower project risk

not:

environmental activism
complex engineering software
waste-management bureaucracy

The website should communicate:

“ReGround gives construction teams a ready-to-manage soil pathway before excavation begins.”
